---
import Portrait from "../components/Portrait.astro";
import Outline from "../components/Outline.astro";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import styles from "./About.module.css";
---

<Layout
	title="About"
	description="About Agustín Díaz, a design engineer working across design and frontend engineering, and the author of adiaz.uy."
	type="AboutPage"
>
	<article class:list={["contentPage", "mx-auto"]}>
		<header class:list={["contentHeading", styles.About]}>
			<h1>
				Hi, I’m <Outline>Agustín</Outline>
			</h1>
			<Portrait
				class={styles.portrait}
				size={224}
				height={280}
				alt="Agustín Díaz"
				fetchpriority="high"
				responsive={{
					widths: [96, 192, 224, 448],
					sizes: "(min-width: 42rem) 14rem, clamp(3.5rem, 22vw, 6rem)",
				}}
			/>
			<div class:list={["contentProse", styles.bio]}>
				<p class={"contentIntro"}>
					I’ve been building on the web since 2009; currently as a Senior Design Engineer at{" "}
					<strong>GitHub</strong>.
				</p>
				<p>
					The browser is where I do my best design work. I like getting an interaction right there,
					then giving it a home in the design system so the next person doesn’t have to start over.
				</p>
			</div>
		</header>
		<div class={"contentProse"}>
			<p>
				I’ve worked at startups like <strong>Personio</strong>, <strong>Frameable</strong>, and{" "}
				<strong>Floship</strong>, and larger companies like <strong>Stripe</strong>,{" "}
				<strong>New Relic</strong>, and <strong>NetSuite</strong>. I craft interfaces that look and
				feel good to use.
			</p>
			<p>
				Attending the{" "}
				<a class={"linkUnderline"} href="https://www.recurse.com/">
					Recurse Center
				</a>{" "}
				made me a better programmer. It’s also where I met some of the kindest people I know.
			</p>
			<h2>Outside work</h2>
			<p>
				My kid keeps me busy. When I get some time to myself, I like to read or play video and board
				games. The Hiro in <em>HiroAgustin</em> is my gaming moniker, borrowed from{" "}
				<a class={"linkUnderline"} href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hiro_Nakamura">
					Hiro Nakamura
				</a>
				, the space-time bending programmer samurai.
			</p>
		</div>
	</article>
</Layout>
